	(descr "SATOZ SAT070AT40D21Y0-35100T071KN 7in 800x480 TFT + GT911 CTP, mechanical only (no pads). Library view = panel FRONT view, origin = 164.9 x 100 outline centre; place on B.Cu (flip left/right) with the panel back 5.0 mm off the PCB back (frame spacer; the 3D model includes the stand-off). Outline 164.90 x 100.00, LCM 3.34 + CTP 1.98 = 5.32 thick; A.A. 154.08 x 85.92 (4.03 / 4.87 from left / top); cover VA 155.08 x 86.92 (3.53 left, 8.85 bottom). Tails: TFT 40p 67.65 long, fingers 19.02..39.52 from the left end; CTP 6p 50 long, fingers 40 from the right end (front view). Sources: SAT spec V.2 sheet 16/18, Fannal CT0476-V2.0")
